# Import and share

- Rule matching lives in `share/ShareDomainRules.kt` (`RouterRules`, `ParseRules`, `UrlDetector`) and is
  covered by `ShareRouterTest`; add a test case for every matching change.
- Stored rule JSON has legacy migrations (`migrateFromLegacy`, `migrateLegacy`); never break decoding
  of older saved rules.
- Plugins may own domains (seeded plugin rules); keep `withPluginHosts` behavior intact.
- Behavior reference: `docs/import-share.md`. History: `../flow-reader-chats/areas/import-share.md`.
